## EXECUTIVE VERDICT

**The CLI local layer is 60-70% implemented. The cloud + dashboard layer is 0% implemented for the new pillars. The system is a working token-compression/dedup tool with provenance and cost foundations bolted on locally — but NONE of the 4-pillar intelligence reaches the cloud or dashboard.**

| Layer | Spec Coverage | Reality |
|-------|:---:|---|
| CLI (Rust) | ~65% | Provenance capture, cost tracking, budget policies, blame, pricing — all local-only |
| Proto schema | ~50% | CLI proto has all event types; cloud proto stuck at compression+dedup era |
| Cloud (Go) | ~5% | Zero provenance/cost/governance/quality endpoints. Only compression analytics |
| Dashboard (Next.js) | ~5% | Zero new pages. Only Overview/Projects/Waste/ROI/Security/Billing |

