## INFRASTRUCTURE GAPS

### Cloud Proto Drift (CRITICAL BLOCKER)

```
CLI proto (cli/proto/events.proto):     Cloud proto (cloud/proto/events.proto):
  EVENT_TYPE_COMPRESSION = 1             EVENT_TYPE_COMPRESSION = 1  ✅
  EVENT_TYPE_DEDUP = 2                   EVENT_TYPE_DEDUP = 2        ✅
  EVENT_TYPE_PROVENANCE = 3              ❌ MISSING
  EVENT_TYPE_COST = 4                    ❌ MISSING
  EVENT_TYPE_GOVERNANCE = 5              ❌ MISSING
  EVENT_TYPE_QUALITY = 6                 ❌ MISSING
  + ProvenanceEvent message              ❌ MISSING
  + CostEvent message                    ❌ MISSING
  + GovernanceEvent message              ❌ MISSING
  + QualityEvent message                 ❌ MISSING
  + ContributorType enum                 ❌ MISSING
```

**Impact:** CLI can emit provenance/cost/governance/quality events, but cloud ingest CANNOT deserialize them. The entire cloud pipeline is blind to Pillars 1-4.

### Spec says EVENT_TYPE_SESSION = 4 — CLI has no SESSION event at all

The spec defines `EVENT_TYPE_SESSION = 4` but the CLI proto jumps from PROVENANCE=3 to COST=4. Session lifecycle events are missing entirely.

### Cloud API — Zero new endpoints

All cloud API routes serve compression/dedup/waste analytics:
```
POST /v1/events         — ingest (compression+dedup only)
GET  /v1/overview       — token savings
GET  /v1/projects       — project list
GET  /v1/savings/trend  — savings chart
GET  /v1/waste          — waste report
GET  /v1/security/alerts
GET  /v1/billing/status
GET  /v1/export/csv     — compression data CSV
GET  /v1/roi            — token savings ROI
```

Missing from spec: cost-per-PR, provenance query, budget policy, compliance export, quality dashboard.

### Dashboard — Zero new pages

Existing pages: Overview, Projects, Waste, ROI, Security, Billing, Settings.
Missing from spec: Cost Analytics, Provenance View, Budget Management, Quality Metrics, Compliance Reports.

