## TOP 5 CRITICAL GAPS (ordered by impact)

1. **Cloud proto drift** — Cloud can't ingest ANY Pillar 1-4 events. Blocks all cloud features.
2. **model_id always "unknown"** — Provenance records have no real model attribution. Entire blame system shows "unknown" for the most important field.
3. **`codeflow gate` missing** — No CI/CD quality gate. No dependency hallucination check. Pillar 3 is essentially unbuilt.
4. **`codeflow audit` missing** — No compliance export. No SLSA/CycloneDX/SOC2/EU AI Act reports. Pillar 4 is essentially unbuilt.
5. **Router-budget disconnect** — Model routing ignores budget state. The "save money when budget tight" story doesn't work.

